+# Fixed Writer MS Word 97 export of literal Normal paragraphs. The two nearest
+# retained exports share this CFB container, but the styled one is deliberately
+# outside the plain paragraph profile below. Keep the compatibility decisions
+# isolated from arbitrary inputs handled by extract_doc and extract_dot.
